Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.36,0:00:06.71,Note,0,0,0,0,,（至今走过的路）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.13,0:00:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 迪恩 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Dean. It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.45,0:00:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你回来多久了 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long you been back, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.80,0:00:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,一年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}About a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.63,0:00:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一整年你一直都在\N{\fnArial\fs30}You been back practically this whole time?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.71,0:00:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你终于美梦成真 你渴望一个家\N{\fnArial\fs30}You finally had what you wanted. You wanted a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.22,0:00:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你去 你是个猎魔人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to go. You're a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.38,0:00:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是萨姆 他变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Sam. He's different.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.15,0:00:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他的灵魂 不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's his soul. It's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.32,0:00:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们抓个活生生的始祖给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bag me a live Alpha,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.90,0:00:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就把你家小萨姆的灵魂还给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll give you little Sammy's soul back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.96,0:00:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会等待一个命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're waiting for the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.05,0:00:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的始祖正在组建一支军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their alpha's building an army.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.28,0:00:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,似乎我们就要开战了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like we're going to war.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.17,0:00:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我抓超自然生物来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring me creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.37,0:00:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你是始祖的话 那谁造就了你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you're the first… Who made you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.39,0:00:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,万物皆有源\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all have our mothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.84,0:00:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这些魔怪死了之后 魂归何处呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we freaks die, where do we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.12,0:00:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,天堂上不去 地狱亦无门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not heaven, not hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.96,0:01:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 炼狱 - 我要占领它\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Purgatory. - And I want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.74,0:01:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想拿回我的灵魂 - 我办不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I want my soul back. - I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.82,0:01:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆的灵魂一直被封印在牢笼里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam's soul has been locked in the cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.91,0:01:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,和米迦勒还有路西法一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}with Michael and Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.87,0:01:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,灵魂回到我体内会让我彻底崩溃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Putting this thing back in would smash me to bits.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.32,0:01:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本无法预料会发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have no idea what will happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.07,0:01:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻痹瘫痪 精神错乱 精神性疼痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paralysis, insanity, psychic pain,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.52,0:01:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,巨大的痛苦会让他一辈子不得安宁\N{\fnArial\fs30}so profound that he's locked inside himself for the rest of his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.69,0:01:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}The horseman of Death,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.53,0:01:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,又见面了 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.82,0:01:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 死亡骑士说他能建一个屏障 - 一个屏障\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Death said he can put up a wall. - A wall?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.93,0:01:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱的一切你都会忘记\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't remember hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.10,0:01:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,赌注是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the bet?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.10,0:01:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想让你替我工作一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to be me for one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.00,0:01:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的人生 我的灵魂 我不想要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my life. It's my soul. I don't want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.16,0:01:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要用血孽玷污你的皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to scar your vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.42,0:01:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.19,0:01:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.32,0:01:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,别去碰那个屏障\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't scratch the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.65,0:01:47.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.06,0:02:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.44,0:02:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm great. This is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.66,0:02:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,佩妮 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Penny, it's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.05,0:02:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 洗澡时挂掉的人比坠机的多了去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, a lot more people die in the shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.39,0:02:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,太欣慰了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to know. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.84,0:02:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真没想到我们会遇到这种鬼天气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't think we'd run into any weather, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.55,0:02:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,能不能先着落 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, can we just land? Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.89,0:02:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,再坚持几分钟好吗 很近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couple minutes. All right? We're close.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.12,0:02:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.98,0:02:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是什么 - 啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What was that?! - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.59,0:02:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚有东西从窗前掠过 而且很大只\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something just flew by the window! It was huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.81,0:02:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能就是只鸟罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably just a bird, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.13,0:02:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 斯坦 那绝不是鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No, Stan, that was not a bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.73,0:02:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然是啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, what was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.68,0:02:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.16,0:02:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,佩妮 外面啥都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Penny, there's nothing out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.33,0:02:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.69,0:02:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你闭上眼放松下 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, just close your eyes, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.79,0:02:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 靠到椅背上\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. Just lean back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.78,0:02:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try to relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.17,0:03:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,想一些迷人的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think of someplace nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.45,0:03:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,海浪轻抚沙滩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waves on a beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.04,0:03:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.27,0:03:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohh! Oh, my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.09,0:03:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不要啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.02,0:03:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第6季第12集]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.69,0:03:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.18,0:03:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的灵魂归位了\N{\fnArial\fs30}His soul is in place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.22,0:03:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他还能醒过来么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he ever gonna wake up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.85,0:03:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又不是人类医生 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a human doctor, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.87,0:03:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不能瞎猜下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you take a guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.71,0:03:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.71,0:03:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,很可能醒不来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.81,0:03:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还能再直接点儿 - 抱歉 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, well, don't sugarcoat it. - I'm sorry, Dean,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.74,0:04:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我警告过你别把那灵魂塞回萨姆体内\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I warned you not to put that thing back inside him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.11,0:04:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.40,0:04:06.42,Title,0,0,0,0,,让T-1000（《终结者2》中的机械杀手）到处乱逛 祈祷他千万别开火吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let T-1000 walk around, hope he doesn't open fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.42,0:04:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我跟你说说我触摸他灵魂时的感觉吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me tell you what his soul felt like when I touched it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.50,0:04:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像是被活剥了一样 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like it had been skinned alive, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.88,0:04:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想你弟弟死 就该给他个痛快\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you wanted to kill your brother, you should have done it outright.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.02,0:04:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我老爸总说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like my daddy always said,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.22,0:04:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,酒虽伤肝但却疗心\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Just 'cause it kills your liver don't mean it ain't medicine."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.07,0:04:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆还在睡吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam still asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.69,0:04:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.70,0:04:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会醒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.16,0:04:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.09,0:04:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 他经历过多少大风大浪啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, he's been through how much?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.12,0:05:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,可他总是能挺过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somehow, he always bounces back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.54,0:05:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他从没经历过这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's never been through this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.72,0:05:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有活儿了 - 八成是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Job? - Might be.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.36,0:05:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来帮你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I help?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.03,0:05:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我去图书馆什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send me to the library? Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.87,0:05:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,夫妻俩驾驶轻型飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couple goes up in a light plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.48,0:05:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚在树林里找到飞机残骸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wreckage was just found in the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.17,0:05:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,一对儿巴迪·豪利（摇滚歌手 因飞机坠毁身亡）嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couple of Buddy Hollys?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.16,0:05:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来没什么可疑的呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't really seem like "News of the weird."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.19,0:05:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞行员在17英里外被发现 全身烧焦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pilot was found 17 miles away, flambed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.62,0:05:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,女孩不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girl's just gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.27,0:05:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,没尸体 什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No body, no nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.86,0:05:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我听着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I'm not changing the channel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.61,0:05:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.41,0:05:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.25,0:05:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you …
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.73,0:06:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.97,0:06:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.13,0:06:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw you …
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.73,0:06:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感受到路西法扭断了你的脖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I felt Lucifer snap your neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.42,0:06:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个 小卡那时…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Cass kind of …
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.42,0:06:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡还活着吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass is alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.47,0:06:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 小卡他没事 萨姆 你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Cass … Cass is fine. Sam, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.98,0:06:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实吧 呃…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.68,0:06:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我快饿瘪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.42,0:06:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Sam…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.60,0:06:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.15,0:06:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最后的记忆是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}…What's the last thing you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.35,0:06:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那片旷野 之后我就掉下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The field. And then I fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.72,0:06:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 再之后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. And then?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.76,0:06:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在安全屋里醒过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I woke up in the panic room.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.14,0:06:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.07,0:06:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的不记得…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really don't remember …
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.04,0:06:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱就谢天谢地吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's be glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.27,0:06:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁想记得那些破事儿啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who wants to remember all that hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.34,0:06:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个 我消失了多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, h-how long was I gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.47,0:07:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大概一年半吧 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- About a year and a half. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.20,0:07:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was downstairs…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.12,0:07:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都不记得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't remember anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.74,0:07:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 我怎么回来的 是小卡吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}S-so, how'd I get back? Was it Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.19,0:07:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不全是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.91,0:07:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你干了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, what did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.80,0:07:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和死亡…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and Death …
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.37,0:07:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡 死亡骑士吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death?! The horseman?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.42,0:07:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有我的手段\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had leverage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.03,0:07:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经完事儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.47,0:07:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你确定吗 - 都结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You sure? - It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.54,0:07:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都一笔勾销\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slate's wiped.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.94,0:07:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 真是干净又利落啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, isn't this just neat and clean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.47,0:07:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 这次就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it is … for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.84,0:07:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么要告诉我的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anything else I should know?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.18,0:07:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.82,0:07:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要啤酒吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another beer?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.60,0:07:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.91,0:07:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.82,0:07:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.28,0:08:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.51,0:08:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错 很不错 比我期望的好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's good. Really good. Better than I could have hoped.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.94,0:08:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,咋了 干嘛一副苦逼脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Why the poopface?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.33,0:08:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有所好转我很高兴 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad he's better. I really am.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.76,0:08:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.63,0:08:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那孩子几天前还把刀架我脖子上 准备弑父\N{\fnArial\fs30}That kid went straight-up menendez on me not 10 days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.81,0:08:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在一切就这么过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now it's all just… Erased?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.60,0:08:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我现在看他就浑身不自在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. I'm having a bit of a hard time even looking at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.91,0:08:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时那不是萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.65,0:08:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 或许那并不全是萨姆的本意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe it wasn't all Sam,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.69,0:08:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但确实是他 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it was him, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.66,0:08:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 那你想怎样 鲍比 告诉他一切吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what do you want to do, Bobby? We tell him everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.02,0:08:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我倒想告诉他呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Just wish I could, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.08,0:08:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果咱把那些破事儿都告诉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but if we start throwing that crap at him,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.41,0:08:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,天知道会怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know what's gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.43,0:08:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 说不定 说不定会打破屏障 - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It could … it could crack the wall. - I know. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.55,0:08:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.47,0:08:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我看来 这是个白来的恩赐\N{\fnArial\fs30}As far as I'm concerned, it's a gift horse,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.32,0:08:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,做人要知足\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm not looking for teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.48,0:09:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还要对死亡骑士感恩戴德呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sending Death a damn fruit basket.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.76,0:09:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他早晚会知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna find out, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.54,0:09:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}One way or another,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.28,0:09:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人会告诉他 或者他自己会想明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}someone will tell him, or he'll figure it out on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.55,0:09:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是傻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.27,0:09:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该由我们告诉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He should hear it from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.60,0:09:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱先把这事儿放一放 行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we just leave it alone for the moment, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.00,0:09:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.34,0:09:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你最好做好最坏的打算\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you better prep for the "B" Side,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.89,0:09:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为如果萨姆发现咱们糊弄他\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause when Sam realizes we're shining him…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.13,0:09:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情就不好看了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ain't gonna be cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.91,0:09:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆还在睡吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam still asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.44,0:09:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 让他歇歇吧 待会儿再打给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, let him rest. We'll call him later.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.71,0:09:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,从哪儿打给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call me from where?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.08,0:09:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,俄勒冈有个案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, there's this thing in Oregon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.73,0:09:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太好了 我也去 - 别介\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Great. I'm in. - Whoa, whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.70,0:09:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚「活」过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just got vertical.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.17,0:09:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我醒了 感觉良好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly. I'm up. I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.00,0:09:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,先窝家看几天狗血剧也没啥不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, a few more days of crap cable couldn't hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.85,0:09:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,才怪 当初你从地狱回来时是这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Because that's what you did when you got back from hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.55,0:10:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.55,0:10:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 我和鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, me, and Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.76,0:10:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们去吧 有你俩就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you two go on ahead. You got this covered.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.70,0:10:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我忘了我答应了那个白痴鲁弗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh, forgot I promised that idjit Rufus.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.42,0:10:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,要帮他接电话 所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd work the phones for him, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.36,0:10:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.81,0:10:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.83,0:10:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩好好叙叙 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two enjoy catching up, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.78,0:10:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么回事啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.36,0:10:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,更年期 还喝高了\N{\fnArial\fs30}One part age, three parts liquor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.33,0:10:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的警官 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, you got it, officer. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.18,0:10:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.84,0:10:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好了 除了飞机失事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, get this … besides the crash,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.68,0:10:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这周镇上还发生了两起失踪案\N{\fnArial\fs30}there were two other disappearances in town this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.93,0:10:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的吗 - 对 上周末\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? - Yeah, last weekend,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.86,0:10:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个女大学生在她公寓里消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}a college girl vanished from her apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.86,0:10:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,在十七楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the 17th floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.78,0:10:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 三天前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, three days ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.59,0:10:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个女生放学后就再也没回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}another girl didn't make it home from school.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.24,0:10:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这两人认识吗 - 不认识 没有联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They know each other? - No. No connection.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.74,0:10:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是年轻女性 和飞机失事中的女孩一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just young and female, like the plane-crash girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.81,0:11:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,啥会让一个女孩从半空中消失啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would disappear a girl out of the sky, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.35,0:11:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,问得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.16,0:11:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你从未尝试过吗 - 尝试什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So you never even tried, huh? - Tried?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.06,0:11:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,尝试好好过日子 那件事之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}To go live a life…after.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.18,0:11:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你承诺过的 记得吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do remember you promised that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.46,0:11:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.87,0:11:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为什么不试一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, why didn't you try?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.52,0:11:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes you think I didn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.67,0:11:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你 看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause look at you. Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.70,0:11:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和以前一模一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're exactly the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.37,0:11:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you're probably right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.87,0:11:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉莎和本与我共同生活了一年\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was with them for a year … Lisa and Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.39,0:11:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,一年\N{\fnArial\fs30}A year?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.88,0:11:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.24,0:11:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是不尽人意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.10,0:11:59.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（波特兰）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.60,0:12:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是佩妮·迪瑟婷的妹妹吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're, uh…Penny Dessertine's sister, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.33,0:12:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想问你几个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, we'd just like to ask you a few questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.60,0:12:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前已经有警察来过了 我很累\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, the cops already came by. I'm tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.74,0:12:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们不介意的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, if you don't mind …
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.78,0:12:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我理解 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I understand. Really, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.13,0:12:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这非常痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how hard this must be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.50,0:12:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是想弄清楚事情的原委\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd just like to figure out what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.23,0:12:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,用不了多久 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}This will be quick. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.70,0:12:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Fine. Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.12,0:12:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,佩妮本人很害羞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Penny was very shy. To herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.21,0:12:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一点都不喜欢冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not at all what you'd call adventurous.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.75,0:12:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那干嘛雷雨天气还坐双座飞机出游\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, like flying through a lightning storm in a two-seater?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.16,0:12:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,她其实很害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was terrified of that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.48,0:12:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,她这么做是为了斯坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}She just did it for Stan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.73,0:12:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stan?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.69,0:12:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们刚开始认真交往\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were just starting to get serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.42,0:12:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不想让他觉得 她没兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}She didn't want to seem, you know…not interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.00,0:12:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我多希望我让她呆在家里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wish I'd told her to stay home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.40,0:13:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们连她的遗体都找不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't even have a body to bury.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.14,0:13:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有何发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. What do you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.90,0:13:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来那两个失踪的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, looks like those other two missing girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.91,0:13:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,都为上帝烤过饼干\N{\fnArial\fs30}both baked cookies for the lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.47,0:13:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 啥 密码吗 - 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is that? Code? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.07,0:13:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,教堂唱诗班 糕饼义卖 贞洁戒指社团\N{\fnArial\fs30}Church choir, bake sales, promise-ring clubs …
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.56,0:13:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这类活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}the works.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.43,0:13:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们都是好女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were good girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.09,0:13:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但佩妮都不是基督教徒…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Penny wasn't even a christian, so …
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.76,0:13:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我另有想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have another theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.41,0:13:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,佩妮的日记\N{\fnArial\fs30}Penny's diary.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.60,0:13:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从她房间里偷的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you steal that from her room?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.08,0:13:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真高兴你这么问我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love that you even asked me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.26,0:13:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我干嘛不问 - 没理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And why wouldn't I? - No reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.09,0:13:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,女孩绑架案 如果和宗教无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, girl-nappings … what if it's not about religion?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.11,0:13:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是关于贞洁呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if it's about purity?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.21,0:13:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说 她们都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean you think they're all …
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.05,0:13:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,处女 萨姆 都是处女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Virgins, Sam. Virgins.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.82,0:13:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,佩妮可二十二岁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Penny was 22.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.84,0:13:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 住粉红色的房间 - 那又怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, with a pink room. - So?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.82,0:13:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有泰迪熊\N{\fnArial\fs30}And stuffed teddy bears.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.14,0:13:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 但是你真的认为…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. But you really think …
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.18,0:14:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我决定把我最珍贵的东西献给斯坦」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I've decided I'm going to give Stan my most precious gift."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.30,0:14:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,从你嘴里说出来真是毛骨悚然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. That sounded really creepy coming out of your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.26,0:14:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我语气多生动啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I delivered it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.19,0:14:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 你可以从日记着手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you … you could have led with the diary. You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.88,0:14:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样 就算你说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyways, let's say you're right. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.92,0:14:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会要处女呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who would want virgins?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.79,0:14:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.68,0:14:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢有经验的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I prefer ladies with experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.25,0:15:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.46,0:15:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切发生得太快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It happened so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.63,0:15:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅利莎 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right, Melissa.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.44,0:15:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,袭击你的是什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What came at you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.74,0:15:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以告诉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.48,0:15:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来好像是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It … it looked like a…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.27,0:15:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,一只很大的蝙蝠\N{\fnArial\fs30}…a giant bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.92,0:15:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为我在编故事 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'm making it up, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.23,0:15:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个男人也这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what the other man said.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.80,0:15:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm not the other man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.38,0:15:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,它径直就冲我来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It came right at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.51,0:15:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓 是庞然大物\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was huge. I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.65,0:15:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.26,0:16:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,它攻击了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, it attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.12,0:16:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.48,0:16:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.04,0:16:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我昏倒了 当我醒来后 它不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I passed out, and when I woke up, it was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.06,0:16:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还能想起其他什么事情不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anything else you can think of?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.51,0:16:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything you can tell us,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.90,0:16:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使是无关紧要的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}even if it doesn't seem important?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.73,0:16:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的戒指丢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, my ring got lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.57,0:16:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不就是那东西偷走了 如果说得通的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or else that thing stole it, if that makes any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.29,0:16:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么样的戒指 - 金的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What kind of ring? - Gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.93,0:16:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,贞洁戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promise ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.51,0:16:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,贞洁戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promise ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.01,0:16:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是从 教堂得来的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh… From, like, a church?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.62,0:16:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,代表纯洁的戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like … like a purity ring?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.67,0:16:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.72,0:16:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要问一句\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.64,0:16:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅利莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Melissa…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.58,0:16:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是要对你做什么评判\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, nobody is, uh, judging anybody here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.85,0:16:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me. But…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.74,0:16:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的配得上那戒指吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should you really be wearing that ring?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.87,0:17:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我 我是 - 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, I-I mean, I-I am … - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.57,0:17:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,马特·贝尼那次不算\N{\fnArial\fs30}Matt Barne didn't count.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.89,0:17:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为蝙蝠侠想要强奸她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, you think batman tried to rape her?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.30,0:17:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他确实有很大火气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he does carry a lot of rage.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.33,0:17:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他因为她不是处而拒绝了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he rejected her because she was already dehymenated, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.56,0:17:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.68,0:17:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这说明\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it just goes to show.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.61,0:17:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,开放点儿完全没坏处啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}that being easy's pretty much all upside.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.53,0:17:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 什么东西喜欢处女和金子\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what kind of thing likes virgins and gold?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.31,0:17:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,吹牛老爹（歌手）\N{\fnArial\fs30}P. Diddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.47,0:17:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这感觉真好 - 什么感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know, it's comforting. - What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.04,0:17:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我死了一年 复活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I died for a year, came back,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.07,0:17:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你依然那么的冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're still not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.29,0:17:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 我很风趣的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up. I'm hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.91,0:17:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}This can't be possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.29,0:17:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,说来听听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.29,0:17:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我谷歌了火焰 爪子 飞行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, I googled "Fire, " "Claws, " "Flying, "
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.05,0:17:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,绑架处女 还有金子\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Stealing virgins, " And "Gold, "
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.11,0:17:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次的查询结果都是一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it all takes me to the same place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.84,0:17:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.93,0:17:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔兽世界玩家网站\N{\fnArial\fs30}"World of warcraft" Fansites.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.46,0:18:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道这啥意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.03,0:18:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,龙 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dragons, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.49,0:18:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,看吧 早说过 不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? Told you. Not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.89,0:18:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 很可能就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, it might be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.27,0:18:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么可能 哪儿可能啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How? In what reality?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.11,0:18:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这年头无奇不有\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a strange year.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.79,0:18:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该听听其他人的意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should get a second opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.00,0:18:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你了解龙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you know about dragons?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.22,0:18:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 不了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.14,0:18:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.30,0:18:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这又不是尼斯湖水怪 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they're not like the loch ness monster, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.94,0:18:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,龙不存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dragons aren't real.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.19,0:18:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能打几个电话询问下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you make a few calls?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.29,0:18:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,给谁 霍格沃兹吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}To who? Hogwarts?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.52,0:18:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,试试无妨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Humor me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.16,0:18:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.89,0:18:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是个有学问的绅士\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a gentleman and a scholar.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.41,0:18:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们那失忆的小孩儿怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, how's "Memento" doing over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.85,0:18:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,识破你的什么谎言了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He caught you in any lies yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.21,0:18:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切安好 萨姆向你问好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's fine. Sam says hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.72,0:18:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.58,0:18:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.11,0:19:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比说什么了没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby say anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.03,0:19:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.64,0:19:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸没写过任何关于龙的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad never wrote anything about dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.44,0:19:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.63,0:19:25.19,Title,0,0,0,0,,如果我在里面读到过《大魔域》（80年代奇幻小说） 我会记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd remember if I read "The neverending story" in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.10,0:19:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们最近狩猎过剥皮行者吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, did we hunt a skinwalker lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.90,0:19:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,没印象 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't ring a bell. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.90,0:19:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是 有些模糊的印象\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Just…Dejavu or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.33,0:19:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你确定吗 我发誓 - 别忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you sure? I could have sworn… - You got to remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.99,0:19:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的小脑壳里还有些凌乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}your eggs are still a little scrambled, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.15,0:19:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我很确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, yeah, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.82,0:19:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.68,0:19:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.16,0:19:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 查到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Bobby. What do you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.53,0:19:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我居然没想起她来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't believe she didn't jump right to mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.74,0:20:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,维斯艾克博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Visyak.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.85,0:20:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,中古研究系 西蒙菲莎大学\N{\fnArial\fs30}Medieval studies, S.F.U.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.26,0:20:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,维斯艾克博士 西蒙菲莎大学\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Visyak, S.F.U.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.41,0:20:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,了解 谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.88,0:20:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去旧金山\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. I'm going to San Francisco,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.95,0:20:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到杀这玩意儿的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}figure out how to kill these things.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.74,0:20:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来找到它们的藏身地\N{\fnArial\fs30}You figure out where they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.73,0:20:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下 鲍比有说他们爱在哪歇脚吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-wait. D-did Bobby say where they like to park?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.73,0:20:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.64,0:20:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错 又得靠文献了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Back to the lore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.27,0:20:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么说 它们住在中土吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which says what? That they live in middle-earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.39,0:20:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 山洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Caves.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.23,0:20:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是个书呆子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're such a nerd.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.89,0:21:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.20,0:21:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,放我走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.11,0:21:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.18,0:21:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.06,0:21:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.17,0:21:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.13,0:21:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.39,0:21:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 不然我把另一条也折了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up, or I'll break the other one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.92,0:21:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, get in there. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.61,0:21:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 一切都会好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. It's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.61,0:22:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.81,0:22:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,维斯艾克博士 我是迪恩·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Visyak. My name is Dean Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.38,0:22:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,办公时间是周一和周五\N{\fnArial\fs30}Office hours are Monday and Friday.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.60,0:22:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比·辛格让我来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby Singer sent me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.44,0:22:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.86,0:22:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.35,0:22:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比·辛格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby Singer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.26,0:22:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你下次见他的时候帮我带句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him something for me next time you see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.59,0:22:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.89,0:22:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,直接踢他的蛋蛋就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, just kick him in the jewels.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.87,0:22:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样更诗意点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's more poetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.15,0:22:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩关系还真不太好哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}No love lost between you two, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.78,0:22:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 正好相反\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Just the opposite.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.62,0:22:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.29,0:22:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他来告诉你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's his story to tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.04,0:22:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他个傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.01,0:23:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这次为何而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's this about?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.57,0:23:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.85,0:23:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh…Dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.11,0:23:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.79,0:23:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,咋啦 不来个龙与地下城的玩笑么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, no 12-sided-dice joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.43,0:23:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正龙消失了 我们可以开开它们的玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can joke about them because they've disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.23,0:23:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但它们可不好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they aren't funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.40,0:23:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点也不\N{\fnArial\fs30}At all.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.37,0:23:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚有一条空降到美国了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, one just flew in stateside.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.95,0:23:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.70,0:23:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,和传说丝毫不差\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fits the lore to a "T."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.12,0:23:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会 为什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But how? I mean, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.08,0:23:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,都700年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been 700 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.47,0:23:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 现如今满世界都是怪异现象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Banner crop of crazy all the way around these days, doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.04,0:23:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想知道如何屠龙 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So you want to know how to kill it. - That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.09,0:23:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得有把剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you need a blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.08,0:23:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.95,0:23:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 什么类型的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. What kind of blade?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.15,0:23:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,一把用龙血锻造的剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}One forged with dragon's blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.69,0:23:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是说 杀死一条龙得要一把剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you need one to kill one,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.68,0:23:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是锻造这把剑得杀死一条龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you got to kill one to make one.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.51,0:23:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这怎么行得通\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does that work out?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.42,0:23:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,现今没多少屠龙剑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there aren't many dragon swords around anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.85,0:24:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,全世界最多也就五六把\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five or six, tops, worldwide.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.08,0:24:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是有把圣乔治之剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, there's the sword of St. George,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.36,0:24:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然还有亚瑟王的湖中剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, of course, there's excalibur.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.70,0:24:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有 - 你知道的可真多\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And there's - You know a lot about this stuff, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.53,0:24:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I sure as hell better.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.80,0:24:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的地下室就有一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have one in the basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.55,0:24:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.63,0:24:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,找它用了20年 数不清的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finding it took two decades, countless hours,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.32,0:24:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有和一位东欧大使的几场差劲的性爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}and some really bad sex with an eastern european ambassador,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.71,0:24:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我得到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.09,0:24:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是真的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is not real.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.89,0:24:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that real?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.28,0:24:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是亚瑟王之剑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it excalibur?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.70,0:24:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.82,0:24:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是布朗维克之剑（捷克传说中的杀人魔剑）\N{\fnArial\fs30}This…is the sword of Bruncvik.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.82,0:24:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一生挚爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.79,0:24:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那这个水泥是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, what's with the cement shoe?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.74,0:24:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个时候流行把剑插到石头里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, binding sword to stone used to be all the rage.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.25,0:24:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样可以保护剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}To protect them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.65,0:24:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们怎样才能把这个小可爱拔出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, how do we get this puppy out?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.63,0:24:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了 你懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, come on. You know this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.87,0:24:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,得有一个勇敢的骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need a brave knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.73,0:25:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿意挺身而出去屠龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}who's willing to step up and kill the beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.26,0:25:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.13,0:25:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, I'll, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.46,0:25:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来试一试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it a whirl.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.03,0:25:10.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不介意吧 - 请\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you mind? - Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.30,0:25:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.11,0:25:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never better.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.08,0:25:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,天杀的 这也太牢固了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, son of a bitch! That's really on there!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.81,0:25:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, afraid so.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.58,0:26:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我还有个主意 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, I have another idea. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.25,0:26:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会喜欢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're not gonna like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.54,0:26:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 迪恩在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam. Where's Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.16,0:26:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.99,0:26:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他去见你的朋友了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He went to go see your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.89,0:26:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试着找出这个东西的巢穴在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, look, I'm trying to figure out where this thing lairs up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.22,0:26:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,能帮帮忙不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, little help, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.17,0:26:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,范围是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are the parameters?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.54,0:26:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,基本上是洞穴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caves, basically.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.59,0:26:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但周围几英里内一个都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there's nothing around for miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.03,0:26:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就发散一下思维\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, less literal, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.52,0:26:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那里有什么地方冰冷黑暗潮湿\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else you got local that's cold, dark, and wet?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.95,0:26:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.93,0:26:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.05,0:26:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里没有地铁线路\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no subway lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.24,0:27:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,下水道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sewers.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.61,0:27:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是这个 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That could be it. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.08,0:27:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 等下 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right. - Wait, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.35,0:27:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Um… You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.99,0:27:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 为什么这么问 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, of course. Why? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.59,0:27:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你言行举止有点不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides the way you been acting and talking? Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.87,0:27:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是不是有事要告诉我 - 没\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is there something I should know? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.00,0:27:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只要知道哥斯拉躲哪就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you need to know is where godzilla's holed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.62,0:27:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 去年发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Bobby, what happened this last year?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.22,0:27:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,各种的事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It had its moments.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.12,0:27:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,和以前一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.88,0:27:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你无关 萨姆 怎么可能和你有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got nothing to do with you, sam. How could it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.76,0:27:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. 'course.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.54,0:27:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有需要就给我电话 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Call me if you need anything. - Ye…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.53,0:27:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.32,0:28:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.67,0:28:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你有时间的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, if you got a minute…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.98,0:28:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.37,0:28:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见你活着真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so good to see you alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.16,0:28:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.55,0:28:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼此\N{\fnArial\fs30}You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.52,0:28:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我是想抱抱你 但\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I-I would hug you, but …
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.16,0:28:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样挺尴尬的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would be awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.14,0:28:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,多么荒唐的一年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um… Was a crazy year, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.93,0:28:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我刚和鲍比通过电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I-I just talked to Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.46,0:28:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把所有事都告诉我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He … he told me everything that happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.22,0:28:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,坦白说 你能活下来真的让我很惊讶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frankly, I'm surprised that you survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.21,0:28:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾经求迪恩别那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was begging Dean not to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.91,0:28:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. No, I-I-I can understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.19,0:28:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 它没杀死你简直就是奇迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it's a miracle it didn't kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.04,0:28:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.82,0:28:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 这真是个奇迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's a miracle, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.29,0:28:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how does it feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.78,0:29:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.75,0:29:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然是你找回了灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, to have your soul back, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.51,0:29:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你意思是因为之前我一直没有灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Y-you mean 'cause I was walking around with no soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.13,0:29:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,很棒 小卡 我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really good, Cass. I'm real good.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.82,0:29:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.39,0:29:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我在一些细节上仍然还很模糊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm … I'm just hazy on a few of the details, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.93,0:29:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你可以帮我回忆一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think maybe you could… walk me through?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.77,0:29:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 我完全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! I-I-I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.33,0:29:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不喜欢这种做法\N{\fnArial\fs30}like this at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.85,0:29:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do realize that this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.19,0:29:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是你至今为止摸过最值钱的制品\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the single most valuable artifact you have ever touched.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.58,0:29:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也是我们唯一的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's also the only weapon we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.63,0:29:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我知道我在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know what I'm doing, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.74,0:29:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上我都是跟鲍比学的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I actually learned it all from Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.37,0:29:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论过去发生过什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, whatever happened there,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.33,0:29:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你清楚至少他在这方面是个天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know he's at least a genius at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.87,0:29:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想不想让我杀掉那个龙呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want me to kill that dragon or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.85,0:29:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.14,0:29:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.49,0:30:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们些个破石头以为自己很聪明哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}You rocks think you're so smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.09,0:30:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.59,0:30:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到二十一世纪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the 21st century.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.69,0:30:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞定 往后站点\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.58,0:30:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Now…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.53,0:31:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为它买保险了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got insurance for this, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.79,0:31:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我们该用它干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we supposed to do with this, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.40,0:31:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,给它一针加强剂么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it a booster shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.34,0:31:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,能到手的就这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what we got. All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.73,0:31:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只要靠近点儿就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just gonna have to get a little closer. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.87,0:31:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,山洞找得如何了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we on the caves?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.93,0:31:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是山洞 而是下水道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nowhere. Sewers, on the other hand…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.32,0:31:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个 你看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.29,0:31:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中两起失踪案都发生在离这一英里内\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, two of the disappearances happened within a mile of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.77,0:31:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我觉得我们从这儿开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I think we start there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.97,0:31:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,着手调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}and walk our way around.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.49,0:31:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,棒极了 人人都爱下水道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome. Who doesn't love sewers?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.30,0:31:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.04,0:31:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.05,0:32:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么 我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. Uh, yeah, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.13,0:32:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh! God.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.08,0:32:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚习惯了一种味道 又来个新的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just when I get used to a smell, I hit a new flavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.25,0:32:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们儿 我们已经在这好几个小时了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, we have been here for hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.21,0:32:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么也没发现 我觉得传说不靠谱儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is nothing. I think the lore is off.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.02,0:32:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what if, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.74,0:32:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果龙喜欢豪华酒店呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if dragons like nice hotels?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.78,0:32:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是什么 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is that? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.69,0:32:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.75,0:32:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 也许这里真的有龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, maybe there are dragons here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.42,0:32:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Dean…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.44,0:32:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管那些了 看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not now. Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.09,0:32:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这大蝙蝠也太艺术范儿了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little arts-and-crafty for a giant bat, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.56,0:32:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? Is someone there?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.08,0:33:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.07,0:33:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里 老天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here! Oh, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.43,0:33:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会救你们出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. We're gonna get you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.26,0:33:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 他就要回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick. He's coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.94,0:33:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备用那个刺哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do you think you're gonna stick that?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.09,0:33:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你从哪拿到的 - 动漫展\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where did you get that? - Comic-con.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.08,0:34:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.90,0:35:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,问问我几点了 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Sam. Ask me what time it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.97,0:35:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛不直接躺上面打滚算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you cut to the chase and just roll in it?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.86,0:35:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我难得有点财产\N{\fnArial\fs30}I rarely have wealth.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.22,0:35:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.45,0:35:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.51,0:35:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am so…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.97,0:35:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}So sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.15,0:35:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不知如何开口\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't even begin to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.35,0:35:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.87,0:35:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.56,0:35:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 鲍比吗 - 是小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did Bobby… - Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.01,0:35:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是小卡啊 那小笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass. Friggin' child.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.39,0:35:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你本该告诉我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should have told me, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.98,0:35:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你本来就不该知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You weren't supposed to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.18,0:35:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾经干的好事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I did?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.23,0:35:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,对鲍比 对你\N{\fnArial\fs30}To Bobby? To you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.60,0:36:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然应该知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I should know.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.24,0:36:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 死亡骑士并不只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, Death didn't just.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.02,0:36:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你灵魂放回来 懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}shove your soul back in, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.43,0:36:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在你和你遗忘的那些事中间\N{\fnArial\fs30}He put up the great wall of Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.98,0:36:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,建立起了一道「萨姆之墙」\N{\fnArial\fs30}between you and the things that you don't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.02,0:36:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好是相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And trust me when I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.86,0:36:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不记得的那些事能杀死你\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the things you don't know could kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.88,0:36:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没在说笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.15,0:36:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.08,0:36:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我得弥补过失 至少我要尽力而为\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I have to set things right. Or what I can, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.12,0:36:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.77,0:36:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 我感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I kind of feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.59,0:36:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像自己喝醉了一样头脑不清\N{\fnArial\fs30}like I got slipped the worst mickey of all time…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.54,0:36:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒过来却发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I woke up to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.96,0:36:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把整座城市都给烧毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I had burnt the whole city down.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.01,0:36:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以说那不是我 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you can say it wasn't me, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.70,0:36:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是那个口袋里放着打火机的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the one with the zippo in my pocket, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.42,0:36:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我不觉得事情有那么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm not sure it's that cut and dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.38,0:36:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然我很感激你是想保护我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, look, I a-appreciate you trying to protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.57,0:36:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really do.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.47,0:36:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我想弥补\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I got to fix…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.46,0:36:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该补过的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}what I got to fix.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.07,0:36:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我得知道 我到底做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I need to know what I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.01,0:36:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你不知道那有多危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you don't know how dangerous that could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.42,0:36:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,换作是你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.29,0:36:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧 你也会这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.64,0:36:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.38,0:37:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,小伙子 你们该来看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boys, something I think you ought to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.89,0:37:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,就我能得出最接近的结论\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, as near as I can figure it,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.42,0:37:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,要追溯到十四世纪\N{\fnArial\fs30}this dates back around the 14th century.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.91,0:37:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么语言\N{\fnArial\fs30}What language is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.01,0:37:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,达芬奇密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Da vinci code.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.84,0:37:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,晦涩的纯正拉丁文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real obscure latinate.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.56,0:37:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,得花上我整个黄金岁月才能翻完\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna take me my golden years to translate it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.98,0:37:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外 友情提示 那不是纸张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and, uh, F.Y.I. … That ain't paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.88,0:37:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.79,0:37:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是人皮\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's human skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.86,0:37:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,说正事 我已经弄明白第一部分了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I'm fairly clear on this first bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.25,0:37:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,大意是描述了这么个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}It basically describes this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.50,0:37:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你最可怕的噩梦的背后\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like the backside of your worst nightmares.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.57,0:37:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,充满了血腥尸骨和无尽的黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all blood and bone and darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.34,0:37:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,充满了饥饿邪恶肮脏淫秽的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Filled with the bodies and souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.71,0:37:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,尸体和灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}of all things hungry, sharp, and nasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.32,0:37:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.73,0:37:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我遇到麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ran into trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.14,0:38:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真他妈幸运 我这里人数足够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're damn lucky I got enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.92,0:38:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是你的幸运日 小妞\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your lucky day, little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.68,0:38:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.30,0:38:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,妖怪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.43,0:38:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直就是妖怪之地\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's monsterland.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.17,0:38:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据这个看来 它有好多个名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to this, it goes by many names …
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.08,0:38:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,多数我都念不来\N{\fnArial\fs30}most of which I can't pronounce …
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.85,0:38:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我想你们应该知道「炼狱」\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm thinking you know "Purgatory."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.47,0:38:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,炼狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Purgatory?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.60,0:38:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,棒极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.68,0:38:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that is good to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.76,0:38:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你是说 这些龙怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you're saying that these, uh, dragon freaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.77,0:38:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,蹲在下水道里\N{\fnArial\fs30}were squatting in the sewers.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.87,0:38:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜读炼狱音诗吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and reading tone poems about purgatory?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.61,0:38:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.71,0:38:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们读的是说明书\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're reading an instruction manual.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.25,0:38:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.10,0:38:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你疯狂到想去那种极度扭曲的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're nuts enough to want access to a place that gnarly,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.94,0:39:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这本书将告诉你如何开启这扇大门\N{\fnArial\fs30}this book will show you how to open a door.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.26,0:39:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,炼狱之门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Door to purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.19,0:39:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道有这么个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I know a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.92,0:39:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可是很乐意知道这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}who would have loved to have known about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.55,0:39:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那要怎样打开这扇门\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how do you open the door?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.34,0:39:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,去问那条龙吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask Cloverfield.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.63,0:39:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定他拿走这一页了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm pretty sure he's got that page.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.32,0:39:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我 求你们停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me go! Please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.43,0:39:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.83,0:39:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 求你们不要 - 你放松点会容易得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please don't! - It'll go easier if you relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.35,0:40:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 情况越来越糟 - 糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It gets worse. - Worse?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.09,0:40:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这说的可不是在那里度假之类的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ain't talking about how to take a vacation over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.61,0:40:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是开门让什么东西进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is all about opening a door to let something in.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.91,0:40:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,带什么东西到这里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring something here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.46,0:40:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.57,0:40:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还在研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm working on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.54,0:40:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,能给点提示吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you give us something?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.19,0:40:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有个名字 - 行啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I got a name. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.01,0:40:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,「母亲」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Mother."
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.34,0:40:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,母亲 什么的母亲 龙的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother? M-mother of what? Mother of dragons?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.65,0:40:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.64,0:40:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里提到过几次\N{\fnArial\fs30}It says it a few times here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.32,0:40:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,「万物之母」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Mother of all."
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.29,0:41:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭候大驾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.57,0:41:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们让我等了好久\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kept me waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.52,0:41:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,「万物之母」到底什么意思啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell does "Mother of all" mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.80,0:41:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.03,0:41:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有很多事要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have so much to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.80,0:41:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get started.
